      "text": "Payment Gateway System",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Payment Gateway System",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Au8-Zz2m9gvFRqVgigb_5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 690.3434999782476,
      "width": 328.1038513183594,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1916013341,
      "version": 28,
      "versionNonce": 566558995,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767551607834,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "w1jpbyEHM4YziRUxhPwpA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 42.03603926349433,
      "y": 743.669463293154,
      "width": 915.3993530273438,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1685752413,
      "version": 605,
      "versionNonce": 403045125,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767598884373,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. The user should raise a payment request.\n2. Each payment request should have a dedicated, unique session (idempotent requests).\n3. System should support multiple payment methods, i.e., UPI, Cards, etc.\n4. Payment should have a proper life cycle (Created, Processing, Completed, Failed, Refunded).\n5. There should be a transaction status tracking option for each payment.\n6. Merchants should be notified once the payment is done (webhook triggers).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. The user should raise a payment request.\n2. Each payment request should have a dedicated, unique session (idempotent requests).\n3. System should support multiple payment methods, i.e., UPI, Cards, etc.\n4. Payment should have a proper life cycle (Created, Processing, Completed, Failed, Refunded).\n5. There should be a transaction status tracking option for each payment.\n6. Merchants should be notified once the payment is done (webhook triggers).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CaVgqN6HAM6rJJPcea1Wm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 42.48794721592549,
      "y": 962.4589744677942,
      "width": 384.24383544921875,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1552308971,
      "version": 98,
      "versionNonce": 191873867,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767597304265,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional Requirements",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional Requirements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aglW8NbIBCtp3QR2e8FMj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 43.336541162236244,
      "y": 1020.5629105671833,
      "width": 1075.0792236328125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2036101163,
      "version": 438,
      "versionNonce": 1035629803,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767599061423,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. The system should be highly available outside the transaction.\n2. Each transaction should be idempotent and highly consistent (no double payments or wrong life cycle flow).\n3. Low-latency and highly scalable system.\n4. Client details should be secured (PCI-DSS compliance).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. The system should be highly available outside the transaction.\n2. Each transaction should be idempotent and highly consistent (no double payments or wrong life cycle flow).\n3. Low-latency and highly scalable system.\n4. Client details should be secured (PCI-DSS compliance).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VgsU3UT3wMAnjm-vBzoYf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 47.06879324910369,
